---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ContactLink from '@/components/ui/ContactLink.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Content Policy"
  description={`About the writing on ${SITE.title} and how it may be shared.`}
  updated="11 November 2026"
>
  <h2>About the writing</h2>
  <p>
    The essays and scribbles here are personal reflections: ideas, thoughts and feelings written in Malayalam. They
    express my own views at the time of writing and do not represent any employer, organisation or group. Views can
    change; older entries are kept as they were written, as a record.
  </p>

  <h2>Ownership</h2>
  <p>Unless stated otherwise, all writing on this site is © {SITE.author}. All rights are reserved.</p>

  <h2>Sharing and quoting</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You are welcome to share links to any entry.</li>
    <li>
      You may quote short passages for review, comment or discussion, provided you credit {SITE.author} and link to the
      original entry.
    </li>
    <li>
      Please do not republish entries in full, translate them, or use them commercially without written permission.
    </li>
    <li>
      Collecting the writing in bulk by automated means, including for building datasets, requires prior written
      permission.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Illustrations</h2>
  <p>The cover illustrations on this site are original artwork made for it.</p>

  <h2>Corrections and concerns</h2>
  <p>
    If you find a factual error, or believe something here concerns you unfairly or infringes your rights, please get in
    touch through <ContactLink />. Every message will be read, and corrections will be made where they are due.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
